{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13176","headline":"上礼部杨侍郎 · 皇甫冉","name":"上礼部杨侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郢匠抡材日，辕轮必尽呈。\n敢言当一干，徒欲隶诸生。\n末学慙邹鲁，深仁录弟兄。\n余波知可挹，弱植更求荣。\n绩媿他年败，功期此日成。\n方因旧桃李，犹冀载飞鸣。\n道浅犹怀分，时移但自惊。\n关门惊暮节，林壑废春畊。\n十里嵩峯近，千秋颍水清。\n烟花迷戍谷，墟落接阳城。\n渺默思乡梦，迟回知己情。\n劳歌终此曲，还是苦辛行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}